  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、\r\n初詣で有名な神社",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その神社と近くの店が協賛した\r\nパンフレットとかポスターのモデル……っていう内容だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020050,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "じゃ、じゃあ\r\n着物を着て撮影ってことですよね……！？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わ、わたしでいいのかな……！\r\nでも、す、すごいですよね……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そう、なんだが",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今回、小糸と、もうひとりのモデルと\r\nふたりでの撮影ってことなんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……小糸には、その……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小中学生向けの……\r\n子ども用着物モデルとして参加して欲しいらしくて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸がすごく、イメージに合うから\r\nぜひとのことなんだが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もし小糸がこの仕事を受けたくないなら\r\nそれでもいいと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……少し、考えてみて\r\nどうしたいか教えてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "な、何言ってるんですか？\r\nプロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "や、やるに\r\n決まってるじゃないですか……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020130,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "せっかく頂いたお仕事ですし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020140,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わ、わたしがイメージに合うなんて\r\n光栄じゃないですか！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_down",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020150,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "よ、よーし、そうと決まれば\r\n撮影に向けてポーズも考えなきゃですね……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020160,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "さ、撮影の日にお肌の調子も\r\n良くないとだし……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "………………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020170,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "な、なんですか？\r\nわたしが、オーディションで貰った役ですよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_down",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020180,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "やりたいに、決まってます",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸が本当にやりたい仕事なら\r\nそれでいいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……しつこく聞いてごめんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020190,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ……い、いえ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020200,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わ、わたしも……\r\nごめんなさい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………\r\n──小糸が",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "求められる小糸でいることも\r\n大事かもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも小糸がどうなりたいかが\r\n一番重要だと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020210,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020220,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、そうですよね……\r\nだけど、わたし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020230,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "──目の前に、見えてる目標が欲しくて",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……わかった",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "そこに向かって\r\n走っていこう",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "そうと決まれば\r\n駆け抜けよう",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "同じ目標を\r\n目指すよ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ひとつひとつの仕事をこなしていく中で\r\n小糸がどうなりたいか、考えていくのもいいと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020240,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………はい",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何か気が付いたり、感じたことがあれば\r\nその都度教えてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうやって少しずつ、\r\nなりたい小糸になっていこう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020250,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……そう、ですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020260,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "──なりたいわたし、か……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020260"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸がやりたいって……\r\nやるって決めたなら",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それを全力でサポートするのが\r\n俺の仕事だからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020270,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいコンディションで撮影に臨めるように\r\nしないとな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020280,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………はい",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020290,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020290",
    "autoWaitTime": 2300
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も、小糸と一緒にさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020300,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから小糸もどこに向かっていきたいのか\r\n目標を見つけたら、こうやって教えてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005020310,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……え、えっと\r\nはい……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200502/2022005020310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうやって、小さな目標を\r\nいくつも達成していくうちに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "きっと色々なことができるようになってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
